{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Torment Hexus is a cyberpunk match-3 roguelike. Match elemental tokens on your wristcomp to generate mana, then use that mana to unleash elemental fury on the guards, robots, and bizarre bio-cybernetic creations of an evil corporate tower. Your goal? The CEO at the top, who you'll be showing the express elevator to ground level, via a window.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3238420/extras/iggy_wristcomp.gif?t=1743429063\" /> <img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3238420/extras/ronin_run.gif?t=1743429063\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">En route, you'll need to slot new spell chips into your wristcomp, grab relics from your enemies' smouldering remains, and engage with dozens of nuanced text encounters. Encourage laborers to unionize, cheat the guards in a card game, sabotage experiments, and trade for gear and info in an illicit black market.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3238420?t=1743429063","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3238420/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1743429063","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3238420/4c3faaa8092e38a30ba11b09479ed8ec8547409d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743429063","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3238420/4c3faaa8092e38a30ba11b09479ed8ec8547409d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743429063","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"The protagonist fights and kills security forces, including human guards and robots. Text events include descriptions of people dying, committing suicide, and needing to perform unlicensed medical care with improvised equipment and supplies."},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Torment Hexus is a cyberpunk match-3 roguelike. Match elemental tokens on your wristcomp to generate mana, then use that mana to unleash elemental fury on the guards, robots, and bizarre bio-cybernetic creations of an evil corporate tower. Your goal? The CEO at the top, who you'll be showing the express elevator to ground level, via a window.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3238420/extras/iggy_wristcomp.gif?t=1743429063\" /> <img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3238420/extras/ronin_run.gif?t=1743429063\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">En route, you'll need to slot new spell chips into your wristcomp, grab relics from your enemies' smouldering remains, and engage with dozens of nuanced text encounters. Encourage laborers to unionize, cheat the guards in a card game, sabotage experiments, and trade for gear and info in an illicit black market.</p>","developers":["TMA Games LLC"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3238420/header.jpg?t=1743429063","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257109040,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257109040/movie480.mp4?t=1743429061","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257109040/movie_max.mp4?t=1743429061"},"name":"Announcement trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257109040/e474e44551a06a4d08373ade7ee4c5f57427c562/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1743429061","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store